<title>FRANCE: One ship loading flour in Rouen, one more due.</title>
<headline>One ship loading flour in Rouen, one more due.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>One ship is loading 11,000 tonnes of flour at Rouen destined for Libya, French port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>One more ship is expected in port by May 8 to load 10,500 tonnes of flour, they said. The destination was not specified.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
